    timestep        0.2500 ## fs

    group           acn     type 1 2 3
960 atoms in group acn
    group           co2     type 4 5
90 atoms in group co2
    group           mobile  type 1 2 3 4 5
1050 atoms in group mobile

    variable        nco2   equal count(co2)/3.0
    variable        nacn   equal count(acn)/3.0
    variable        nmob   equal count(mobile)/3.0

    ## to check the system's temperature
    compute         mdtemp mobile temp
    compute_modify  mdtemp dynamic/dof yes

    molecule        mols    ../../share/acnmol.txt
Read molecule template mols:
# C2H3N (UA) molecule file. TraPPE model.
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  3 atoms with max type 3
